## Phase 4: Enhance Finale with Profile Display

### 4a. Add profile data structs

In `BridgeComponent.h`:
```cpp
USTRUCT(BlueprintType)
struct FTranslatorsTrait {
    FString Dimension;    // "cognitive_density"
    FString Label;        // "Balanced"
    float Score;          // 0.0-1.0
    FString Behavior;     // "You can hold moderate complexity"
};

USTRUCT(BlueprintType)
struct FTranslatorsProfile {
    TArray<FTranslatorsTrait> Traits;
    TArray<FString> Insights;
    FString Checksum;
    FString Anchor;
};
```

### 4b. Parse profile from USDA

Add `FTranslatorsProfile ParseCognitiveProfile(const FString& UsdPath)` to BridgeComponent. Uses the existing regex-based USDA parsing pattern to extract traits and insights from `~/.translators/cognitive_profile.usda`.

### 4c. Enhance W_FinaleScreen

Rebuild the widget tree to show:
- Title: "Your Cognitive Profile" (cyan, 36pt)
- Scrollable traits list: dimension | label | score | behavior
- Insights section (3-4 bullet points)
- Checksum/anchor at bottom
- "Exported to ~/.translators/cognitive_profile.usda"

### 4d. Wire through TranslatorsHUD

In `OnFinaleReceived`: parse profile → pass to FinaleScreen → display.

